  <div class=\"name\">新浪新闻视频号</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"qrcode\" data-index=\"3\">\n     <img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/business/transform/400/w200h200/20260119/79ac-cfe5d759c00160129ad5fc3a10ce4c09.png\" alt=\"新浪新闻抖音\">\n     <div class=\"name\">新浪新闻抖音</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"qrcode\" data-index=\"4\">\n     <img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/business/transform/400/w200h200/20260119/7cc6-6e25220df4cd6c8963c864f14676cc74.png\" alt=\"新浪新闻快手\">\n     <div class=\"name\">新浪新闻快手</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"qrcode\" data-index=\"5\">\n     <img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/business/transform/400/w200h200/20260119/1285-057559a3e9d8a49b2c529f32ebeba128.png\" alt=\"新浪新闻小红书\">\n     <div class=\"name\">新浪新闻小红书</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"qrcode\" data-index=\"6\">\n     <img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/business/transform/400/w200h200/20260119/6cf5-410fe0ca4818cfbb5315f8f63a40a1af.png\" alt=\"新浪新闻B站\">\n     <div class=\"name\">新浪新闻B站</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"qrcode\" data-index=\"7\">\n     <img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/business/transform/400/w200h200/20260119/023b-cad34b1b18562aa6f6d032a09ee3e49e.png\" alt=\"热搜时代小宇宙\">\n     <div class=\"name\">热搜时代小宇宙</div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <!-- 放大预览模态框 -->\n   <div class=\"qrcode-modal\" id=\"qrcodeModal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n     <span class=\"modal-close\">×</span>\n     <div class=\"modal-qrcode\">\n      <img id=\"modalQrcodeImg\" src=\"\" alt=\"\">\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"modal-hint\">点击任意位置关闭</div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"search ent-search\" id=\"ent_search\" data-sudaclick=\"cnav_search_p\" style=\"\">\n    <form action=\"//search.sina.com.cn/\" name=\"cheadSearchForm\" id=\"all_search\" method=\"get\" target=\"_blank\">\n     <select name=\"c\" id=\"search_type\" style=\"visibility: hidden;\"> <option value=\"news\">新闻</option> <option value=\"img\">图片</option> <option value=\"video\">视频</option> </select> <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"ie\" value=\"utf-8\">\n     <div class=\"search_div\">\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"search_input\" name=\"q\" value=\"请输入关键词\" onfocus=\"if(this.value == '请输入关键词') this.value = ''\" onblur=\"if(this.value =='') this.value = '请输入关键词'\" autocomplete=\"off\"><input type=\"submit\" id=\"search_submit\" value=\"\">\n     </div>\n    </form>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- 面包削 search end -->\n  <h1 class=\"main-title\">赛后复盘对林仲勋申裕斌夺冠有何帮助？</h1>\n  <!-- page-tools start -->\n  <div class=\"top-bar-wrap\" id=\"top_bar_wrap\">\n   <div class=\"top-bar ani\" id=\"top_bar\">\n    <div class=\"top-bar-inner clearfix\">\n     <div class=\"second-title\">赛后复盘对林仲勋申裕斌夺冠有何帮助？</div>\n     <div class=\"date-source\" data-sudaclick=\"share_1-0\">\n      <span class=\"date\">2026年10月10日 06:24</span> <a href=\"http://www.sina.com.cn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"source ent-source\" data-sudaclick=\"content_media_p\" style=\"color:#FF6861\">新浪网</a> <span class=\"author\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#888\">作者 \n       <div class=\"avatar-wrap\">\n        <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"http://n.sinaimg.cn/sinakd10216/360/w180h180/20251231/6b5f-8b6da7b5f371ef01fe83d76121c5f57e.jpg\" alt=\"avatar\">\n       </div> \n       <a href=\"http://k.sina.com.cn/mediaDocList.d.html?uid=7879995911\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"source ent-source\" data-sudaclick=\"content_author_p\" style=\"color:#FF6861\">体育先锋眼</a> </span>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"page-tools\">\n      <span class=\"tool-icon tool-des-fs first\" data-sudaclick=\"content_smallerfont_i\">缩小字体</span> <span class=\"tool-icon tool-ins-fs\" data-sudaclick=\"content_biggerfont_i\">放大字体</span> <span class=\"tool-icon tool-fav\" data-sudaclick=\"content_fav_p\">收藏</span> <span class=\"tool-icon tool-wb\" data-sudaclick=\"content_weiboshare_i\">微博</span> <span class=\"tool-icon tool-wx\" data-sudaclick=\"content_wechatshare_i\">微信</span> <span class=\"tool-icon tool-share\">分享</span> <span class=\"tool-cmt\"><span><span class=\"icon-comment\"></span><span class=\"num\" node-type=\"comment-num\">0</span></span></span>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- page-tools end -->\n  <!-- 正文 start -->\n  <div class=\"article-content clearfix\" id=\"article_content\">\n   <!-- 左侧 start -->\n   <div class=\"article-content-left\">\n    <!-- 正文广告top start -->\n    <div class=\"ad top-ad\">\n     <ins class=\"sinaads\" data-ad-pdps=\"PDPS000000060750\"></ins>\n    </div>\n    <!-- 正文广告top end -->\n    <!-- 引文 start -->\n    <!-- 引文 end -->\n    <!-- 正文 start -->\n    <div class=\"article\" id=\"article\">\n     <p>　　<span>一、邓亚萍复盘：赢在对手先松手，自己豁出去</span></p>\n     <p>　　<span>松劲节点：邓亚萍指出，第四局林昀儒/郑怡静10:3领先时“有点松了，以为冠军已经拿到手了”，被韩国组合一分分追回；决胜局5:1换边后又“不会了”，最终被逆转。</span></p>\n     <p>　　<span>逆转关键：在她看来，林仲勋/申裕斌是“起死回生”，绝境下豁出去、个个球发力，打得非常漂亮，双方都发挥了高水平、出手果敢不手软。</span></p>\n     <p>　　<span>技术分析：第四局3:10落后时两人针对反手底线长球施压，在落后时提升出手质量、变化接发球线路，放手一搏。</span></p>\n     <p>　　<span>二、赛后复盘如何真正帮到他们</span></p>\n     <p>　　<span>直接关联：林仲勋在夺冠采访中明确表示，对比此前欧洲大满贯失利的经历，这次胜利尤其不易，赛后复盘对本次取胜起到了关键作用。</span></p>\n     <p>　　<span>信任与战术：两人反复强调，混双最重要的是互相信任，同时要发挥出自己的技战术。</span></p>\n     <p>　　<span>心态转变：复盘让他们在落后时反而更豁得出去，关键分处理得比对手更果断，这份心理韧性是逆转的底色。</span></p>\n     <p>　　<span>三、一场足以载入年度经典的逆转</span></p>\n     <p>　　<span>比分进程：五局比分为12-14、11-9、16-18、13-11、11-8，两度落后、两度扳平，决胜局又是在1:5落后下连得8分翻盘。</span></p>\n     <p>　　<span>赛后反应：林仲勋赛后走到场边腿软跪地，与申裕斌拥抱，两人在采访中互相致谢，申裕斌谦虚表示“全部都是因为他才赢的”。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"font-size: .24rem;color: #888;font-weight: 400;\">本文由AI生成</p>\n     <div class=\"article-notice\" style=\"border: 1px solid #FF6861;border-radius: 4px;padding: 20px;font-family: MicrosoftYaHei;font-size: 14px;color: #FF6861;line-height: 24px;margin-top: 30px;\">特别声明：以上文章内容仅代表作者本人观点，不代表新浪网观点或立场。如有关于作品内容、版权或其它问题请于作品发表后的30日内与新浪网联系。</div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- t id=\"news_web_article_v2017_fold\" _pos=\"正文页折叠\" _live=true -->\n    <!-- 正文 end -->\n    <!--蜂鸟推广位 start-->\n    <div class=\"fengniao-container\">\n     <div class=\"fengniao-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://weibo.com/u/5893229038\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"fengniao-card-image\" src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/default/393/w253h140/20251230/d8d0-a01eca45e0968e8dbf7a84cd93d27d89.png\" alt=\"赛博对话\"></a>\n      <div class=\"fengniao-card-text\">\n       <a href=\"https://weibo.com/u/5893229038\" target=\"_blank\">赛博对话</a>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"fengniao-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c01fbc657dae09d80ed3e8\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"fengniao-card-image\" src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/business/590/w380h210/20251230/42c1-6d47eef12123fc526c6a2419e692d911.png\" alt=\"热搜时代\"></a>\n      <div class=\"fengniao-card-text\">\n       <a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c01fbc657dae09d80ed3e8\" target=\"_blank\">热搜时代</a>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"fengniao-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://weibo.com/u/1653545015\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"fengniao-card-image\" src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/default/393/w253h140/20251230/2610-6a5ddd2488c703d5b602186367cea78b.png\" alt=\"一天零一页\"></a>\n      <div class=\"fengniao-card-text\">\n       <a href=\"https://weibo.com/u/1653545015\" target=\"_blank\">一天零一页</a>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"fengniao-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://weibo.com/u/3231920057\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"fengniao-card-image\" src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/default/392/w252h140/20251230/e517-24aadeb9b7792f31e16905b195c830cb.png\" alt=\"无双\"></a>\n      <div class=\"fengniao-card-text\">\n       <a href=\"https://weibo.com/u/3231920057\" target=\"_blank\">无双</a>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"fengniao-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://weibo.com/u/6979546667\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"fengniao-card-image\" src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/default/393/w253h140/20251230/13a0-49a96b620e8ac451608603a6a9623c49.png\" alt=\"热浪之外\"></a>\n      <div class=\"fengniao-card-text\">\n       <a href=\"https://weibo.com/u/6979546667\" target=\"_blank\">热浪之外</a>\